question: Which Building has been allotted to xxxx xxx?
query: SELECT EMP.EmployeeName,EMP.JobName,EMP.FatherName,EMP.DepartmentName,EMP.DesignationName,BUIL.BuildingName  FROM [acom].[AccommodationAllotment] ACOM
INNER JOIN emp.vw_EmployeesList EMP ON ACOM.EmployeeId=EMP.Id
INNER JOIN [acom].[BuildingMapping] BM ON ACOM.BuildingMappingId=BM.ID
INNER JOIN [mst].[Building] BUIL ON BM.BuildingId=BUIL.ID
WHERE EMP.EmployeeName LIKE 'xxxx xxx' AND ACOM.AllotmentStatusId=2


